   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Cursor\n\nAn animated mouse pointer that follows a scripted path to a button, clicks it with a ripple, and the button shows hover, press, loading and success.\n\nCategory: ui. Length: 4.5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A product demo needs a pointer guiding the eye and clicking a control.\n- Showing a click with a ripple and a press dip.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You need a scripted path across a whole scene with several targets: place the cursor as an overlay in your own timeline.\n- A text insertion point: use caret.\n\nVariables:\n- variant (enum): Variant, default \"arrow\"\n- size (number, 14-64): Size, default 28\n- ripple_color (color): Ripple color, default \"\"\n- label (string): Button label, default \"Continue\"\n- mode (enum): Theme, default \"light\"\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent background, default false\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
